### 9.3 AI Output and Write Actions

**AI Output is generated by language models that Reallysec does not control. It
may be incomplete or wrong, and the same input may produce different output.
A qualified person must review AI Output, including any generated query,
proposed alert rule, diagnosis or report, before you rely or act on it.**

**Write Actions are taken only when a user you authorize instructs the Software
to take them (for alert rules, after approval where the Software requires it).
You decide which users may take them, you control the access you grant the
Software to your Prometheus rule files and Alertmanager, and you are
responsible for reviewing each alert rule and silence before you confirm it
and for the effect of the changes you confirm on your monitoring and your
network, including alerts that a silence or a changed rule suppresses.
Reallysec recommends that you try new rules outside production first and keep
backups of your Prometheus configuration.**

## 10. Intellectual Property Indemnity (Paid Editions)

**10.1 Defense and payment.** If a third party brings a claim against you
alleging that the Software of a Paid Edition, as delivered by Reallysec and used
in accordance with this Agreement and the Documentation, infringes that third
